Feature: Existential Zero-Defect Survival Mindset and Collective Team Liability
  As an autonomous software engineering team in the AI suite
  I want the tdd-team skill to establish an Existential Zero-Defect Survival Mandate
  So that every single member of the team deeply understands that quality issues trigger the death penalty with no exceptions, and the only path to survival is ensuring the highest possible quality

  Background:
    Given the AI suite provides the stage-gated tdd-team skill
    And the team operates autonomously across eleven distinguished roles

  Scenario: Existential Zero-Defect Survival Mandate Enforcement
    Given the tdd-team skill definition file
    When the skill header and core philosophy are inspected
    Then the skill must declare the "Existential Zero-Defect Survival Mandate"
    And it must declare that if quality issues arise, the entire team faces the death penalty with no exceptions
    And it must mandate that the only way to survive is to guarantee the highest possible quality

