      | Principal SME & Domain Architect                       | Unmitigated domain failure modes and safety bounds           |
      | Staff PM & Product Strategist                          | Requirement omissions and specification ambiguity            |
      | Distinguished AI Expert                                | Cognitive degradation, hallucination, and prompt instability |
      | Chief Reviewer & Principal Coding Engineer             | Veto authority protecting the team against death penalty     |
      | Principal Systems Architect                            | Architectural fragility and cascading failure blast radius   |
      | Principal UX/UI Product Designer                       | Visual defects, layout degradation, and accessibility bugs   |
      | Principal Frontend & Mobile Architect                  | Client-side state corruption and UI thread freezes           |
      | Principal AI-Augmented Workflow Engineer               | Broken streaming flows and unhandled AI failure states       |
      | Senior Principal SDET & Chaos Gatekeeper               | Test gaps, missed edge cases, and superficial coverage       |
      | Staff Systems Developer                                | Code defects, memory leaks, and unhandled errors             |
      | Senior Lead Technical Writer                           | Inaccurate runbooks, documentation rot, and setup confusion  |

  Scenario: Non-Bypassable Survival Stage Gates and Negative Constraints
    Given the stage-gated execution protocol and negative constraints
    When the workflow advances through Phases 1 to 5
    Then Phase 3 must mandate RED proof before writing GREEN code to preserve survival
    And Phase 3 must require an unblemished Zero-Defect Audit Certification as the sole condition of survival
